@startuml 個人送養發佈-Python文件互動
title 案例1: 個人送養發佈流程 (Python 文件互動層級)

participant "Flask Request" as Request
participant "animals.py\n@animals_bp.route" as Blueprint
participant "flask_jwt_extended\nJWTManager" as JWT
participant "user.py\nUser Model" as UserModel
participant "animal.py\nAnimal Model" as AnimalModel
participant "minio_helper.py\nget_minio_client()" as MinIO
participant "db\nSQLAlchemy" as DB
participant "config.py\nConfig" as Config

== API 1: POST /api/animals - 建立動物草稿 ==
Request -> Blueprint: POST /api/animals\n@jwt_required()
activate Blueprint

Blueprint -> JWT: get_jwt_identity()
JWT --> Blueprint: current_user_id

Blueprint -> DB: db.session.get(User, user_id)
activate DB
DB -> UserModel: 查詢 User 實例
UserModel --> DB: User object
DB --> Blueprint: user
deactivate DB

Blueprint -> Blueprint: 判斷動物類型:\nif user.role == SHELTER_MEMBER:\n    shelter_id = user.primary_shelter_id\nelse:\n    owner_id = current_user_id

Blueprint -> AnimalModel: Animal(\n    name, species, breed,\n    status=DRAFT,\n    shelter_id/owner_id,\n    created_by=current_user_id\n)
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel --> Blueprint: animal instance
deactivate AnimalModel

Blueprint -> DB: db.session.add(animal)\ndb.session.commit()
activate DB
DB --> Blueprint: animal_id assigned
deactivate DB

Blueprint --> Request: 201 Created\n{animal: animal.to_dict()}

== API 2: POST /api/animals/{id}/images - 上傳圖片 ==
Request -> Blueprint: POST /api/animals/{id}/images\n@jwt_required()
activate Blueprint

Blueprint -> JWT: get_jwt_identity()
JWT --> Blueprint: current_user_id

Blueprint -> DB: Animal.query.filter_by(\n    animal_id, deleted_at=None\n).first()
activate DB
DB -> AnimalModel: 查詢 Animal
AnimalModel --> DB: animal
DB --> Blueprint: animal
deactivate DB

Blueprint -> Blueprint: 權限檢查:\nif animal.owner_id != current_user_id\n    and not (shelter_member check):\n    abort(403)

Blueprint -> Blueprint: import base64\nheader, base64_data = image_url.split(',')\nimage_data = base64.b64decode(base64_data)

Blueprint -> MinIO: get_minio_client()
activate MinIO
MinIO -> Config: Config.MINIO_ENDPOINT\nConfig.MINIO_ACCESS_KEY
Config --> MinIO: 配置參數
MinIO --> Blueprint: minio_client
deactivate MinIO

Blueprint -> MinIO: minio_client.bucket_exists(bucket_name)
activate MinIO
MinIO --> Blueprint: True/False
Blueprint -> MinIO: minio_client.make_bucket(bucket_name)\n[if not exists]
deactivate MinIO

Blueprint -> MinIO: minio_client.put_object(\n    bucket_name,\n    storage_key,\n    image_stream,\n    len(image_data),\n    content_type\n)
activate MinIO
MinIO --> Blueprint: 上傳成功
deactivate MinIO

Blueprint -> Config: Config.MINIO_EXTERNAL_ENDPOINT\nConfig.MINIO_BUCKET
Config --> Blueprint: endpoint, bucket

Blueprint -> Blueprint: final_url = f"http://{endpoint}/{bucket}/{storage_key}"

participant "animal.py\nAnimalImage Model" as ImageModel

Blueprint -> DB: db.func.max(AnimalImage.order)\n.filter_by(animal_id)
activate DB
DB --> Blueprint: max_order
deactivate DB

Blueprint -> ImageModel: AnimalImage(\n    animal_id,\n    storage_key,\n    url=final_url,\n    mime_type,\n    order=max_order + 1\n)
activate ImageModel
ImageModel --> Blueprint: image instance
deactivate ImageModel

Blueprint -> DB: db.session.add(image)\ndb.session.commit()
activate DB
DB --> Blueprint: image_id assigned
deactivate DB

Blueprint --> Request: 201 Created\n{image: image.to_dict()}

== API 3: PATCH /api/animals/{id} - 更新動物資料 ==
Request -> Blueprint: PATCH /api/animals/{id}\n@jwt_required()
activate Blueprint

Blueprint -> JWT: get_jwt_identity()
JWT --> Blueprint: current_user_id

Blueprint -> DB: Animal.query.filter_by(\n    animal_id, deleted_at=None\n).first()
activate DB
DB --> Blueprint: animal
deactivate DB

Blueprint -> Blueprint: 權限檢查 (owner/shelter member)

Blueprint -> AnimalModel: animal.name = data['name']\nanimal.species = Species(data['species'])\nanimal.breed = data['breed']\n...
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel --> Blueprint: 屬性已更新
deactivate AnimalModel

Blueprint -> DB: db.session.commit()
activate DB
DB --> Blueprint: 更新成功
deactivate DB

Blueprint --> Request: 200 OK\n{animal: animal.to_dict()}

== API 4: POST /api/animals/{id}/submit - 提交審核 ==
Request -> Blueprint: POST /api/animals/{id}/submit\n@jwt_required()
activate Blueprint

Blueprint -> JWT: get_jwt_identity()
JWT --> Blueprint: current_user_id

Blueprint -> DB: Animal.query.filter_by(\n    animal_id, deleted_at=None\n).first()
activate DB
DB --> Blueprint: animal
deactivate DB

Blueprint -> Blueprint: 權限檢查 + 狀態檢查:\nif animal.status != DRAFT:\n    abort(400)

Blueprint -> AnimalModel: animal.status = AnimalStatus.SUBMITTED
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel --> Blueprint: 狀態已更新
deactivate AnimalModel

Blueprint -> DB: db.session.commit()
activate DB
DB --> Blueprint: 更新成功
deactivate DB

Blueprint --> Request: 200 OK\n{status: SUBMITTED}

== API 5: POST /api/animals/{id}/publish - 管理員發布 ==
Request -> Blueprint: POST /api/animals/{id}/publish\n@jwt_required()
activate Blueprint

Blueprint -> JWT: get_jwt_identity()
JWT --> Blueprint: current_user_id

Blueprint -> DB: db.session.get(User, current_user_id)
activate DB
DB --> Blueprint: current_user
deactivate DB

Blueprint -> UserModel: current_user.role
activate UserModel
UserModel --> Blueprint: UserRole.ADMIN (檢查)
deactivate UserModel

Blueprint -> Blueprint: if role != ADMIN:\n    abort(403)

Blueprint -> DB: Animal.query.filter_by(\n    animal_id, deleted_at=None\n).first()
activate DB
DB --> Blueprint: animal
deactivate DB

Blueprint -> AnimalModel: animal.status = AnimalStatus.PUBLISHED
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel --> Blueprint: 狀態已更新
deactivate AnimalModel

Blueprint -> DB: db.session.commit()
activate DB
DB --> Blueprint: 更新成功
deactivate DB

Blueprint --> Request: 200 OK\n{status: PUBLISHED}

== API 6: POST /api/animals/{id}/reject - 管理員拒絕 ==
Request -> Blueprint: POST /api/animals/{id}/reject\n@jwt_required()
activate Blueprint

Blueprint -> JWT: get_jwt_identity()
JWT --> Blueprint: current_user_id

Blueprint -> Blueprint: 檢查管理員權限

Blueprint -> DB: Animal.query.filter_by(\n    animal_id, deleted_at=None\n).first()
activate DB
DB --> Blueprint: animal
deactivate DB

Blueprint -> Blueprint: if animal.status != SUBMITTED:\n    abort(400)

Blueprint -> AnimalModel: animal.status = DRAFT\nanimal.rejection_reason = data['rejection_reason']\nanimal.rejected_at = datetime.utcnow()\nanimal.rejected_by = current_user_id
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel --> Blueprint: 屬性已更新
deactivate AnimalModel

Blueprint -> DB: db.session.commit()
activate DB
DB --> Blueprint: 更新成功
deactivate DB

Blueprint --> Request: 200 OK\n{status: DRAFT, rejection_reason}

@enduml

@startuml 領養申請提交-Python文件互動
title 案例2: 領養申請提交流程 (Python 文件互動層級)

participant "Flask Request" as Request
participant "applications.py\n@applications_bp.route" as Blueprint
participant "flask_jwt_extended\nJWTManager" as JWT
participant "user.py\nUser Model" as UserModel
participant "animal.py\nAnimal Model" as AnimalModel
participant "application.py\nApplication Model" as AppModel
participant "notification_service.py\nNotificationService" as NotificationService
participant "others.py\nNotification Model" as NotificationModel
participant "email_tasks.py\nCelery Tasks" as EmailTask
participant "celery.py\nCelery App" as Celery
participant "db\nSQLAlchemy" as DB

== API 1: POST /api/applications - 提交領養申請 ==
Request -> Blueprint: POST /api/applications\n@jwt_required()
activate Blueprint

Blueprint -> JWT: get_jwt_identity()
JWT --> Blueprint: current_user_id (applicant_id)

Blueprint -> DB: db.session.get(User, current_user_id)
activate DB
DB -> UserModel: 查詢 User
UserModel --> DB: User object
DB --> Blueprint: current_user
deactivate DB

Blueprint -> UserModel: current_user.role
activate UserModel
UserModel --> Blueprint: role (must be GENERAL_MEMBER)
deactivate UserModel

Blueprint -> Blueprint: if role != GENERAL_MEMBER:\n    abort(403, "只有一般會員可申請")

Blueprint -> DB: Animal.query.filter_by(\n    animal_id=data['animal_id'],\n    deleted_at=None\n).first()
activate DB
DB -> AnimalModel: 查詢 Animal
AnimalModel --> DB: animal
DB --> Blueprint: animal
deactivate DB

Blueprint -> AnimalModel: animal.status
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel --> Blueprint: status
deactivate AnimalModel

Blueprint -> Blueprint: 狀態檢查:\nif status == ADOPTED:\n    abort(400, "已被領養")\nif status != PUBLISHED:\n    abort(400, "無法申請")

Blueprint -> Blueprint: 刊登者檢查:\nif animal.owner_id == current_user_id:\n    abort(400, "不能申請自己的動物")

Blueprint -> DB: Application.query.filter_by(\n    animal_id, deleted_at=None\n).filter(status IN [PENDING, UNDER_REVIEW])\n.first()
activate DB
DB -> AppModel: 查詢待審核申請
AppModel --> DB: existing_pending
DB --> Blueprint: any_pending
deactivate DB

Blueprint -> Blueprint: if any_pending:\n    abort(409, "有待審核申請")

Blueprint -> DB: Application.query.filter_by(\n    animal_id, applicant_id,\n    deleted_at=None\n).filter(status IN [PENDING, ...]).first()
activate DB
DB --> Blueprint: existing
deactivate DB

Blueprint -> Blueprint: if existing:\n    abort(409, "已提交申請")

Blueprint -> AppModel: Application(\n    animal_id,\n    applicant_id,\n    type='ADOPTION',\n    status=PENDING,\n    submitted_at=utcnow(),\n    contact_phone,\n    contact_address,\n    occupation,\n    housing_type,\n    has_experience,\n    reason,\n    notes\n)
activate AppModel
AppModel --> Blueprint: application instance
deactivate AppModel

Blueprint -> DB: db.session.add(application)\ndb.session.commit()
activate DB
DB --> Blueprint: application_id assigned
deactivate DB

Blueprint -> NotificationService: notify_application_submitted(\n    application,\n    applicant_name,\n    animal_name\n)
activate NotificationService

NotificationService -> DB: Animal.query.get(application.animal_id)
activate DB
DB --> NotificationService: animal
deactivate DB

NotificationService -> NotificationService: 確定接收者:\nrecipient_id = animal.owner_id\nif not recipient_id and shelter_id:\n    recipient_id = shelter.primary_account_user_id

NotificationService -> NotificationModel: Notification(\n    recipient_id,\n    type='application_submitted',\n    actor_id=applicant_id,\n    payload={\n        application_id,\n        animal_id,\n        animal_name,\n        applicant_name\n    },\n    read=False\n)
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel --> NotificationService: notification instance
deactivate NotificationModel

NotificationService -> DB: db.session.add(notification)\ndb.session.commit()
activate DB
DB --> NotificationService: notification_id
deactivate DB

NotificationService --> Blueprint: notification created
deactivate NotificationService

Blueprint --> Request: 201 Created\n{application: application.to_dict()}

== API 2: POST /api/applications/{id}/review - 審核申請 ==
Request -> Blueprint: POST /api/applications/{id}/review\n@jwt_required()\n{action: 'approve'/'reject'}
activate Blueprint

Blueprint -> JWT: get_jwt_identity()
JWT --> Blueprint: current_user_id (reviewer_id)

Blueprint -> DB: db.session.get(User, current_user_id)
activate DB
DB --> Blueprint: current_user
deactivate DB

Blueprint -> DB: Application.query.filter_by(\n    application_id, deleted_at=None\n).first()
activate DB
DB --> Blueprint: application
deactivate DB

Blueprint -> DB: Animal.query.get(application.animal_id)
activate DB
DB --> Blueprint: animal
deactivate DB

Blueprint -> Blueprint: 權限檢查:\nhas_permission = False\nif animal.owner_id == current_user_id:\n    has_permission = True\nelif (shelter member check):\n    has_permission = True\nif not has_permission:\n    abort(403)

Blueprint -> Blueprint: if application.status not in\n    [PENDING, UNDER_REVIEW]:\n    abort(400)

alt action == 'approve'
    Blueprint -> AppModel: application.status = APPROVED\napplication.reviewed_at = utcnow()\napplication.assignee_id = current_user_id\napplication.review_notes = data['review_notes']\napplication.version += 1
    activate AppModel
    AppModel --> Blueprint: 更新完成
    deactivate AppModel
    
    Blueprint -> AnimalModel: animal.status = ADOPTED\nanimal.updated_at = utcnow()
    activate AnimalModel
    AnimalModel --> Blueprint: 狀態已更新
    deactivate AnimalModel
    
    Blueprint -> DB: db.session.commit()
    activate DB
    DB --> Blueprint: 更新成功
    deactivate DB
    
    Blueprint -> NotificationService: notify_application_reviewed(\n    application,\n    reviewer_id,\n    status='APPROVED',\n    review_notes\n)
    activate NotificationService
    
    NotificationService -> DB: Animal.query.get(animal_id)
    activate DB
    DB --> NotificationService: animal
    deactivate DB
    
    NotificationService -> NotificationModel: Notification(\n    recipient_id=application.applicant_id,\n    type='application_approved',\n    actor_id=reviewer_id,\n    payload={status, review_notes}\n)
    activate NotificationModel
    NotificationModel --> NotificationService: notification
    deactivate NotificationModel
    
    NotificationService -> DB: db.session.add(notification)\ndb.session.commit()
    activate DB
    DB --> NotificationService: saved
    deactivate DB
    
    NotificationService --> Blueprint: notification created
    deactivate NotificationService
    
    Blueprint -> EmailTask: send_application_notification_email_task.delay(\n    applicant_email,\n    animal_name,\n    status='approved',\n    review_notes,\n    contact_info={owner/shelter info}\n)
    activate EmailTask
    
    EmailTask -> Celery: @celery.task decorator\nEnqueue task to Redis/RabbitMQ
    activate Celery
    Celery --> EmailTask: task_id
    deactivate Celery
    
    EmailTask --> Blueprint: Task enqueued (非同步)
    deactivate EmailTask
    
    note right of Celery: Celery Worker 異步處理:\n1. email_service.send_email()\n2. 使用 application_notification.html 模板\n3. 發送郵件給申請人

else action == 'reject'
    Blueprint -> AppModel: application.status = REJECTED\napplication.reviewed_at = utcnow()\napplication.assignee_id = current_user_id\napplication.review_notes = data['review_notes']\napplication.version += 1
    activate AppModel
    AppModel --> Blueprint: 更新完成
    deactivate AppModel
    
    Blueprint -> DB: db.session.commit()
    activate DB
    DB --> Blueprint: 更新成功
    deactivate DB
    
    Blueprint -> NotificationService: notify_application_reviewed(\n    application,\n    reviewer_id,\n    status='REJECTED',\n    review_notes\n)
    activate NotificationService
    
    NotificationService -> NotificationModel: Notification(\n    recipient_id=applicant_id,\n    type='application_rejected',\n    actor_id=reviewer_id,\n    payload={status, review_notes}\n)
    activate NotificationModel
    NotificationModel --> NotificationService: notification
    deactivate NotificationModel
    
    NotificationService -> DB: db.session.add(notification)\ndb.session.commit()
    activate DB
    DB --> NotificationService: saved
    deactivate DB
    
    NotificationService --> Blueprint: notification created
    deactivate NotificationService
    
    Blueprint -> EmailTask: send_application_notification_email_task.delay(\n    applicant_email,\n    animal_name,\n    status='rejected',\n    message=review_notes\n)
    activate EmailTask
    EmailTask -> Celery: Enqueue task
    Celery --> EmailTask: task_id
    EmailTask --> Blueprint: Task enqueued
    deactivate EmailTask
    
    note right of AnimalModel: 動物狀態保持 PUBLISHED\n其他人可繼續申請
end

Blueprint --> Request: 200 OK\n{application: application.to_dict()}

@enduml